@knowvah/plantuml-themes-unlicensed — licence statement

This package contains eight PlantUML theme files, copied verbatim from
PlantUML's `src/main/resources/themes/` directory:

  amiga, blueprint, crt-amber, crt-green, mimeograph, plain (Matthew Leather)
  mono (Denis Bondarenko feat Matthew Leather)
  carbon-gray (Bharat Rajagopalan)

Their authors stated no licence. Each file's YAML header names its author and
leaves the `license:` field empty or absent. No licence is granted here,
because the authors granted none: this package is NOT MIT, and "unlicensed"
does NOT mean "The Unlicense" or the public domain.

The files are redistributed exactly as PlantUML itself redistributes them,
inside its own distribution, unmodified, with each author's header kept
verbatim. If you redistribute this package, you are responsible for deciding
whether that is acceptable for your use.

If an author grants the MIT licence for their theme, the theme moves back into
the MIT core of @knowvah/plantuml-engine and leaves this package.

The small JavaScript wrapper in `index.js` and `index.d.ts`, written for
plantuml-engine, is MIT-licensed, as the rest of plantuml-engine is.

See LICENSES.md for the per-theme table, and issue #180 of
https://github.com/knowvah/plantuml-engine for the ruling behind this package.
